Your refund is waiting..... You have a tax refund of 1540.10 GBP waiting from your previous revenue records. Unfortunately we were not able to process your information because your details did not match. Due to this issue, we have to re-verify your information. We know you want the convenience of receiving instant refund without delay of your money but due to bank processes it can't be done immediately(Max 3 - 4 days) because we are taking our time in making sure accurate refunds and verifications are being made. To process your refund, please follow the ""REFUND DEPARTMENT"" link below: Refund Department We take your online safety seriously, which is why we use state-of-the-art notification systems to identify unusual activity and a challenge process to validate your details. Thanks for your Correspondent. Customer Finance Department &#169; HM REVENUE & CUSTOMS 2011. Disclaimer: HM Revenue&Customs plc are authorized and regulated by the Financial Services Authority. FSA authorization can be checked on the FSA's Register at: www.hmrc.gov.uk/register. Are members of the Financial Services Compensation Scheme and the Financial Ombudsman Service. This email was sent by HM Revenue&Customs plc Registered Office: 25 Gresham Street, London EC2V 7HN. Registered in England and Wales no. 2065.",i01,Information Provision,"GENERAL SETTINGS
