12273,"Your PayPal Account Will Be Closed
Dear Member we are making a few changes View Online Dear Member we are making a few changes View Online Your PayPal Account Will Be Closed Hello, Dear Member. Your Account Will Be Closed, Until We Here From You. To Update Your Information. Simply click on the web address below What do I need to do? Confirm My Account Now Help Contact Security How do I know this is not a Spoof email? Spoof or 'phishing' emails tend to have generic greetings such as ""Dear PayPal member"". Emails from PayPal will always address you by your first and last name. Find out more here. This email was sent to paypal@user.com. Copyright ? 1999-2017. All rights reserved. PayPal PTE. Ltd. Address is 5 Temasek Boulevard #09-01 Hunter Tower 5 Singapore 038985",i01,Information Provision,"GENERAL SETTINGS
