RST TO THE BANK AS A RELATION OR NEXT OF KING THE DECEASED INDICATING YOUR BANK ACCOUNT NUMBER AND LOCATION WHERE THE MONEY WILL BE REMITTED. UPONRECEIPT OF YOUR REPLY I WILL SEND TO YOU THE TEXT THE APPLICATION. AS SOON AS YOU RECEIVE THIS LETTER, YOU SHOULD CONTACT ME AT ONCE THROUGH MY E-MAIL SECUREDADDRESS: foreignoperations@cititrust-bank.comTRUSTING TO HEAR FROM YOU IMMEDIATELY.YOURS FAITHFULLY, DR.ZAHID MALLAMHEAD: FOREIGN OPERATIONS.",i06,Contact and Conversation,"GENERAL SETTINGS
