20925,"Please verify and update your PayPal account !
PayPal - Limited Account Access Details PayPal is constantly working to ensure security by regularly screening the accounts in our system. We recently reviewed your account, and we need more information to help us provide you with secure service. Until we can collect this information, your access to sensitive account features will be limited or terminated. We would like to restore your access as soon as possible, and we apologize for the inconvenience. Why is my account access limited? Your account access has been limited for the following reason(s): It has come to our attention that your PayPal Billing Information. Failure to update your records will result in account termination. Please update your records in maximum 72 hours. Once you have updated them, your PayPal session will not be interrupted and will continue as normal. Failure to update them will result in cancellation of service, Terms of Service (TOS) violations or future billing problems. (Your case ID for this reason is PP-121-601-924.) How can I restore my account access? How can I update my account? Please visit the Update Center and complete the quot;Steps to Remove Limitations and Update your Account.quot; Completing all the checklist items will automatically restore your account access.",i09,Software and Device Operations,"GENERAL SETTINGS
